{
  "_about": "The Locked Folder's shared interface (UI contract 1.2), a protected document: before any page the client asks media.vault's status, shows its own unlock prompt while the vault is locked (whose \"Forgot your PIN?\" opens the forgot page: the recovery key, or what else can be done) and the setup page while it can't be opened yet, keeps the unlock alive while shown, asks the status again after every action it runs and locks on leaving (docs/reference/ui-contract.md, \"Protected documents\"). Photo opens it from its Albums through the section action; it is the Locked Folder's only interface on both clients (docs/satellites/locked_folder.md, \"Shared interface\"). It reads the read-only views (views.py: gallery, setup, settings) and changes the vault only through its existing routes, each needing what it always has: upload, delete, move_out and media/file for a download; configuration (the location), pin, recover, encryption/* and delink. Every PIN and recovery key is asked in the client's own prompt (secrets) and a new recovery key shown in its own dialog (reveal), never in a form. Nothing is shared, kept offline or shown as a widget. A phone turns biometric unlock on (with the PIN) or off from the Android app's unlock card.",
  "contract": "starcore.ui/1.2",
  "title": "Locked Folder",
  "protected": {"capability": "media.vault", "setup": "setup", "forgot": "forgot"},
  "entry": "vault",
  "pages": {
    "vault": {
      "source": {"route": "gallery?limit=120"},
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "text", "style": "caption", "text": "$.summary"},
        {"type": "button", "label": "Add files", "style": "secondary",
         "action": {"upload": {"multiple": true}, "route": "upload?name={$value.name}", "then": "refresh"}},
        {"type": "button", "label": "Settings", "style": "secondary", "action": {"navigate": "settings"}},
        {
          "type": "media-grid",
          "id": "vault",
          "items": "$.items",
          "more": {"route": "gallery?limit=120&cursor={$value}", "cursor": "$.next"},
          "size": "medium",
          "empty": "Nothing here yet. Move photos in from Photos, or add files.",
          "item": {"image": "media/{$.preview}?path={$.path}", "key": "$.path", "kind": "$.kind", "group": "$.group", "icon": "$.icon"},
          "viewer": {
            "image": "media/file?path={$.path}",
            "video": "media/file?path={$.path}",
            "title": "$.name",
            "fields": [
              {"label": "Added", "value": "$.modified", "format": "datetime"},
              {"label": "Size", "value": "$.size", "format": "bytes"},
              {"label": "Folder", "value": "$.folder"},
              {"label": "File", "value": "$.name"}
            ],
            "actions": [
              {"label": "Move to Photos", "icon": "image", "visible": "$.movable",
               "action": {"route": "move_out", "body": {"paths": ["$.path"]}, "confirm": "Move this back to Photos? It leaves the Locked Folder and is no longer behind your PIN.", "then": "refresh"}},
              {"label": "Download", "icon": "download", "action": {"download": "media/file?path={$.path}&download=1", "name": "$.name"}},
              {"label": "Delete forever", "icon": "trash-2", "style": "danger",
               "action": {"route": "delete", "body": {"paths": ["$.path"]}, "confirm": "Delete this for good? This can't be undone.", "then": "refresh"}}
            ]
          },
          "selection": {
            "actions": [
              {"label": "Move to Photos", "icon": "image",
               "action": {"route": "move_out", "body": {"paths": ["$.path"]}, "confirm": "Move the selected items back to Photos? They leave the Locked Folder and are no longer behind your PIN.", "then": "refresh"}},
              {"label": "Delete forever", "icon": "trash-2", "style": "danger",
               "action": {"route": "delete", "body": {"paths": ["$.path"]}, "confirm": "Delete the selected items for good? This can't be undone.", "then": "refresh"}}
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "setup": {
      "title": "Locked Folder",
      "source": {"route": "setup"},
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "heading", "text": "$.title"},
        {"type": "text", "text": "$.message"},
        {"type": "form", "visible": "$.needs_location",
         "fields": [{"key": "path", "label": "Folder on the server", "kind": "text", "placeholder": "/srv/starcore/private", "required": true}],
         "submit": {"label": "Use this folder",
                    "action": {"route": "configuration", "body": {"key": "locked_folder_path", "value": "$form.path"}, "then": "refresh"}}},
        {"type": "button", "label": "Create PIN", "visible": "$.needs_pin",
         "action": {"route": "pin", "secrets": {"pin": {"kind": "pin", "new": true}}}},
        {"type": "button", "label": "Set a new PIN with the recovery key", "visible": "$.recoverable",
         "action": {"route": "recover", "secrets": {"recovery_key": {"kind": "recovery-key"}, "pin": {"kind": "pin", "new": true}}}},
        {"type": "field", "label": "Problem", "value": "$.problem", "visible": "$.problem", "developer": true}
      ]
    },
    "forgot": {
      "title": "Forgot your PIN?",
      "source": {"route": "setup?forgot=1"},
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "heading", "text": "$.title"},
        {"type": "text", "text": "$.message"},
        {"type": "button", "label": "Set a new PIN with the recovery key", "visible": "$.recoverable",
         "action": {"route": "recover", "secrets": {"recovery_key": {"kind": "recovery-key"}, "pin": {"kind": "pin", "new": true}}}}
      ]
    },
    "settings": {
      "title": "Settings",
      "source": {"route": "settings"},
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "card", "title": "PIN", "blocks": [
          {"type": "text", "style": "caption", "text": "$.biometric_note"},
          {"type": "button", "label": "Change PIN", "style": "secondary",
           "action": {"route": "pin", "secrets": {"current_pin": {"kind": "pin"}, "pin": {"kind": "pin", "new": true}}}}
        ]},
        {"type": "card", "title": "Encryption", "blocks": [
          {"type": "text", "text": "$.encryption"},
          {"type": "text", "style": "caption", "text": "$.recovery", "visible": "$.recovery"},
          {"type": "button", "label": "Encrypt with a recovery key", "visible": "$.can_encrypt",
           "action": {"route": "encryption/start", "body": {"recovery_key": true}, "reveal": "recovery_key",
                      "confirm": "Encrypt the Locked Folder? You'll see its recovery key once - store it safely. Your originals are kept as a backup until you delete them.",
                      "then": "refresh"}},
          {"type": "button", "label": "Encrypt without a recovery key", "style": "secondary", "visible": "$.can_encrypt",
           "action": {"route": "encryption/start", "body": {"recovery_key": false},
                      "confirm": "Encrypt without a recovery key? Without one, these files are lost for good if this server's key is lost - for example after reinstalling, or a Windows password reset.",
                      "then": "refresh"}},
          {"type": "button", "label": "$.resume_label", "visible": "$.can_resume",
           "action": {"route": "encryption/start", "body": {}, "then": "refresh"}},
          {"type": "button", "label": "Undo encryption", "style": "secondary", "visible": "$.can_undo",
           "action": {"route": "encryption/undo", "body": {"run": "$.interrupted_run"},
                      "confirm": "Undo this encryption? Every original goes back where it was, unencrypted.", "then": "refresh"}},
          {"type": "button", "label": "New recovery key", "style": "secondary", "visible": "$.has_recovery_key",
           "action": {"route": "encryption/recovery_key", "secrets": {"pin": {"kind": "pin"}}, "reveal": "recovery_key",
                      "confirm": "Make a new recovery key? The current one stops working.", "then": "refresh"}},
          {"type": "button", "label": "Create recovery key", "style": "secondary", "visible": "$.no_recovery_key",
           "action": {"route": "encryption/recovery_key", "secrets": {"pin": {"kind": "pin"}}, "reveal": "recovery_key", "then": "refresh"}},
          {"type": "button", "label": "Remove recovery key", "style": "danger", "visible": "$.has_recovery_key",
           "action": {"route": "encryption/recovery_key", "body": {"remove": true}, "secrets": {"pin": {"kind": "pin"}},
                      "confirm": "Remove the recovery key? Without it, a forgotten PIN or a lost server key means these files are lost for good.",
                      "then": "refresh"}}
        ]},
        {"type": "card", "title": "Backups", "visible": "$.has_backups", "blocks": [
          {"type": "text", "style": "caption", "text": "Unencrypted originals kept when the Locked Folder was encrypted. Delete them once you're sure the encrypted files open."},
          {"type": "list", "items": "$.backups",
           "item": {"title": "$.title", "subtitle": "$.created", "value": "$.bytes", "format": {"subtitle": "datetime", "value": "bytes"}},
           "action": {"navigate": "backup", "params": {"run": "$.id"}}}
        ]},
        {"type": "card", "title": "Location", "blocks": [
          {"type": "field", "label": "Folder", "value": "$.path"},
          {"type": "text", "style": "caption", "visible": "$.path_missing",
           "text": "This folder is missing on the server. Restore it, or delink the Locked Folder and link another one."},
          {"type": "button", "label": "Delink", "style": "danger",
           "action": {"route": "delink", "confirm": "Delink the Locked Folder? Its folder and files stay on disk untouched, but StarCore stops protecting them until you link a folder again."}}
        ]}
      ]
    },
    "backup": {
      "title": "Backup",
      "params": ["run"],
      "source": {"route": "settings?run={$params.run}"},
      "blocks": [
        {"type": "text", "text": "$.summary"},
        {"type": "field", "label": "Kept since", "value": "$.created", "format": "datetime"},
        {"type": "field", "label": "Size", "value": "$.bytes", "format": "bytes"},
        {"type": "button", "label": "Restore originals", "style": "secondary",
         "action": {"route": "encryption/undo", "body": {"run": "$params.run"},
                    "confirm": "Put these originals back unencrypted and remove their encrypted copies?", "then": "back"}},
        {"type": "button", "label": "Delete backup", "style": "danger",
         "action": {"route": "encryption/discard", "body": {"run": "$params.run"}, "secrets": {"pin": {"kind": "pin"}},
                    "confirm": "Delete this backup? Every encrypted copy is checked first. The backup is then deleted permanently.", "then": "back"}}
      ]
    }
  }
}
